/-!
# Recognition of small completions of full general Ree extensions

The full F.4.3 extension and its whole-overlap completion retain the native
linear/Suzuki marking. For every positive Ree parameter the entire carrier
order bound forces equal order and a generalized octagon. The marked native
images generate a normal native-amalgam completion of exactly the native
group order. The actual Cartan image fixes exactly the two marked neighbors
at each native endpoint, including at q=8. The thin fixed graph closes the
marked apartment and gives the native eighth-power relation. The paired
completion then supplies full order equality and a faithful type-preserving
action containing all inner automorphisms of the native Ree group.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith F.4.3–17 and F.4.24, pp.274–283,287–288.
-/
